WEBVTT

00:00:01.980 --> 00:00:03.230
<b>Whoo!</b>

00:00:03.230 --> 00:00:04.480
<b>Field Day is coming up!</b>

00:00:04.480 --> 00:00:05.860
<b>Make your wild side explode!</b>

00:00:05.860 --> 00:00:07.730
<b>Make your wild side explode!</b>

00:00:05.860 --> 00:00:08.860
<b>Whoo!</b>

00:00:05.860 --> 00:00:08.860
<b>Field Day is
 coming up!</b>

00:00:06.810 --> 00:00:08.860
<b>Field Day</b>

00:00:08.110 --> 00:00:08.860
Seton Academy

00:00:11.670 --> 00:00:12.860
<b>Cooking Room</b>

00:00:11.670 --> 00:00:12.860
Okay, everyone!

00:00:12.860 --> 00:00:15.240
The cooking club's gonna go for the win!

00:00:15.240 --> 00:00:17.490
Let's do this!

00:00:18.140 --> 00:00:19.450
Huh? Wha?

00:00:19.770 --> 00:00:20.830
I won't be in it.

00:00:20.830 --> 00:00:21.530
Huh?!

00:00:21.530 --> 00:00:24.380
Sorry, me either. It's a 
little too scary for me.

00:00:24.380 --> 00:00:26.020
I'm not the athletic type.

00:00:26.020 --> 00:00:26.920
What?!

00:00:26.920 --> 00:00:29.750
Taking a nap is a lot easier.

00:00:29.750 --> 00:00:31.900
H-Hang on a minute!

00:00:32.380 --> 00:00:35.480
We should all be in it together! We can win!

00:00:35.480 --> 00:00:37.250
Let go of me, you dumb dog!

00:00:37.950 --> 00:00:40.510
You know there's no way we can win!

00:00:41.980 --> 00:00:44.260
But it's an order from your boss!

00:00:44.260 --> 00:00:47.810
I want us all to win together!

00:00:47.810 --> 00:00:49.490
It sounds fun.

00:00:51.860 --> 00:00:53.030
Miyubi?

00:00:53.450 --> 00:00:56.280
I'd like... to compete in Field Day.

00:00:56.660 --> 00:00:57.570
Really?!

00:00:57.570 --> 00:01:00.200
But I don't think I can...

00:01:00.200 --> 00:01:01.950
Don't worry, Miyubi!

00:01:01.950 --> 00:01:04.470
I'll be there for you!

00:01:17.490 --> 00:01:21.950
<b>Join the Pack!</b>

00:01:19.410 --> 00:01:21.950
<b>Seton Academy</b>

00:01:42.850 --> 00:01:43.580
<b>Unnatural interspecies relations are strictly forbidden!!</b>

00:01:53.300 --> 00:01:53.590
<b>Miyubi: Dead</b>

00:02:38.010 --> 00:02:40.380
<b>Seton Academy Record 5      Who Was Brave?</b>

00:02:39.550 --> 00:02:40.380
Okay, Miyubi!

00:02:40.740 --> 00:02:42.260
We'll train together!

00:02:42.680 --> 00:02:45.640
I bet the three-legged race 
is something we can do.

00:02:45.640 --> 00:02:51.050
Ranka-chan... thank you... 
for doing this with me.

00:02:51.050 --> 00:02:53.150
Of course! I'm your boss, after all!

00:02:53.480 --> 00:02:57.900
I was really happy when you 
said you wanted to compete.

00:02:58.240 --> 00:03:01.340
So let's surprise Jin and the others!

00:03:01.340 --> 00:03:02.530
Yeah.

00:03:02.910 --> 00:03:05.740
Okay, we'll start with the inside leg.

00:03:06.190 --> 00:03:07.670
One, two...

00:03:09.610 --> 00:03:11.620
Mi... Mi...

00:03:11.620 --> 00:03:14.290
Miyubi!

00:03:12.600 --> 00:03:14.290
<b>Miyubi: Dead</b>

00:03:14.290 --> 00:03:17.910
Sorry. That was too much 
to start out with for you.

00:03:17.910 --> 00:03:20.820
I'm... fi—

00:03:19.260 --> 00:03:21.470
How could you do such a thing?!

00:03:23.820 --> 00:03:26.970
W-We were just practicing a little!

00:03:27.310 --> 00:03:29.530
No! Under Miyubi-san's butt!

00:03:29.530 --> 00:03:30.300
Huh?

00:03:30.730 --> 00:03:32.630
My... butt?

00:03:35.210 --> 00:03:37.690
<b>Moleo: Dead</b>

00:03:35.340 --> 00:03:37.170
Moleo!

00:03:38.330 --> 00:03:39.530
I'm sorry.

00:03:39.990 --> 00:03:41.900
I didn't know you were there.

00:03:41.900 --> 00:03:43.620
What were you guys doing?

00:03:43.620 --> 00:03:47.570
Performing maintenance on the school 
grounds in preparation for Field Day.

00:03:47.570 --> 00:03:49.770
All right! You guys will draw the lines!

00:03:49.770 --> 00:03:51.420
Right!

00:03:54.420 --> 00:03:55.790
Moleo!

00:03:56.120 --> 00:03:57.040
Really?

00:03:59.510 --> 00:04:00.260
Huh?

00:04:00.260 --> 00:04:02.490
R-Ranka-san!

00:04:02.490 --> 00:04:05.140
Why don't you let us help you out?

00:04:05.140 --> 00:04:08.290
It'll be perfect to help Miyubi 
build up some stamina!

00:04:16.370 --> 00:04:18.800
Miyubi! Keep it up!

00:04:18.800 --> 00:04:20.070
Right...

00:04:21.820 --> 00:04:24.070
There's no line at all!

00:04:24.520 --> 00:04:28.180
I think it'll go a lot faster 
if we do it ourselves.

00:04:28.180 --> 00:04:29.080
Yes, but...

00:04:29.570 --> 00:04:31.910
We owe Ranka-san a debt.

00:04:31.910 --> 00:04:34.100
We will work together until it's done!

00:04:34.100 --> 00:04:36.170
Yeah!

00:04:37.490 --> 00:04:40.170
Miyubi!

00:04:38.650 --> 00:04:40.170
<b>Cause of Death:</b>

00:04:38.650 --> 00:04:40.170
<b>Carried a Tool That
 Was Too Heavy</b>

00:04:40.170 --> 00:04:42.210
Miyubi!

00:04:41.900 --> 00:04:42.910
<b>Cause of Death:
 Crushed Under a Tent Cloth</b>

00:04:42.910 --> 00:04:45.800
Miyubi!

00:04:44.900 --> 00:04:45.800
<b>Cause of Death:</b>

00:04:44.900 --> 00:04:45.800
<b>The Wind Blew</b>

00:04:46.860 --> 00:04:48.310
Miyubi died again!

00:04:48.310 --> 00:04:50.100
Oh, she died again!

00:04:50.100 --> 00:04:52.630
I thought she'd already died,
 but she died again!

00:04:51.390 --> 00:04:54.600
We're not getting anywhere!

00:04:57.190 --> 00:04:58.610
It's this way, Jin-kun.

00:04:58.610 --> 00:05:01.730
<i>Why did she want me to follow her?</i>

00:05:01.730 --> 00:05:03.610
<i>Does she want to confess her love to me?!</i>

00:05:03.610 --> 00:05:05.570
Look, Jin-kun!

00:05:05.990 --> 00:05:06.930
Over there.

00:05:09.740 --> 00:05:14.750
One, two... One, two... One, two... One, two...

00:05:14.750 --> 00:05:17.980
They're training, and they 
kept it a secret from us?

00:05:17.980 --> 00:05:19.750
They want to take part in Field Day.

00:05:22.380 --> 00:05:23.930
Just a little more...

00:05:26.130 --> 00:05:29.780
We did it! A new record!

00:05:34.870 --> 00:05:36.890
Congratulations!

00:05:37.300 --> 00:05:39.770
We got our work finished in time, too!

00:05:40.170 --> 00:05:42.660
I guess were actually just in your way. Sorry.

00:05:42.660 --> 00:05:43.730
It's fine!

00:05:44.180 --> 00:05:46.870
At first, I wasn't sure how 
things would turn out,

00:05:46.870 --> 00:05:50.340
but seeing Miyubi-san refusing 
to di—to give up

00:05:50.340 --> 00:05:52.370
gave us courage, too!

00:05:53.500 --> 00:05:54.460
Miyubi-san!

00:05:55.370 --> 00:05:57.480
When Field Day comes...

00:05:57.480 --> 00:05:59.000
We wish you luck!

00:06:00.710 --> 00:06:01.820
Thanks.

00:06:05.660 --> 00:06:09.510
There's no way we can get 
out of competing tomorrow.

00:06:11.580 --> 00:06:13.260
Yeah, I guess not.

00:06:13.260 --> 00:06:15.380
We're just gonna lose, though.

00:06:16.240 --> 00:06:17.260
<b>Field Day</b>

00:06:17.260 --> 00:06:18.390
Whoo!

00:06:18.390 --> 00:06:19.650
It's Field Day!

00:06:19.650 --> 00:06:22.150
Make your wild side explode!

00:06:24.150 --> 00:06:26.440
<b>Seton Academy Field Day</b>

00:06:26.740 --> 00:06:26.900
<b>Seton Academy Field Day</b>

00:06:26.900 --> 00:06:29.850
We're gonna win! We're gonna win! 
We're gonna win! We're gonna win!

00:06:29.850 --> 00:06:31.940
Would you calm down already?

00:06:29.850 --> 00:06:33.390
We're gonna win! We're gonna win! 
We're gonna win! We're gonna win!

00:06:31.940 --> 00:06:34.150
Well, if it isn't the cooking club!

00:06:34.150 --> 00:06:35.370
That voice...

00:06:35.370 --> 00:06:36.860
The stupid zebra!

00:06:36.860 --> 00:06:39.090
Wow! Kuroe, it's been ages!

00:06:39.090 --> 00:06:43.430
I see you're still hanging around with 
this rude, foolish human, Ranka-san.

00:06:43.430 --> 00:06:44.880
And I see you...

00:06:45.280 --> 00:06:47.250
are still hanging around with donkeys.

00:06:47.250 --> 00:06:49.630
It's your fault this happened to me!

00:06:49.630 --> 00:06:50.550
But!

00:06:50.550 --> 00:06:53.170
You shouldn't underestimate me.

00:06:53.170 --> 00:06:54.910
Despite how I look, I am now...

00:06:54.910 --> 00:06:57.030
a world champion at the internationally renowned

00:06:57.030 --> 00:07:00.560
donkey card game, Magic: The Donkeys!

00:07:02.330 --> 00:07:05.460
We will be the ones to win at Field Day today.

00:07:05.460 --> 00:07:08.720
Behold the teamwork we have 
perfected through these cards—

00:07:08.720 --> 00:07:09.320
What?

00:07:09.320 --> 00:07:13.950
But I think you need a group 
of at least five to qualify...

00:07:17.430 --> 00:07:19.850
Miyubi-chan still isn't here.

00:07:19.850 --> 00:07:21.710
What? Where could she be?

00:07:24.550 --> 00:07:25.450
Miyubi!

00:07:25.900 --> 00:07:26.550
Huh?

00:07:26.900 --> 00:07:29.050
I'm here!

00:07:29.390 --> 00:07:31.300
Sorry I'm a bit late.

00:07:31.300 --> 00:07:34.550
The sloth is fast now!

00:07:31.300 --> 00:07:34.550
Miyubi-san is fast now!

00:07:31.300 --> 00:07:34.550
Miyubi is fast now!

00:07:31.300 --> 00:07:34.550
Miyubi-chan is fast now!

00:07:35.610 --> 00:07:37.570
What happened, Miyubi-chan?

00:07:37.570 --> 00:07:39.680
I woke up like this for some reason!

00:07:39.680 --> 00:07:42.440
Let's all do our best today!

00:07:42.810 --> 00:07:45.010
She even talks faster.

00:07:45.010 --> 00:07:46.690
It's like she's a different animal.

00:07:46.690 --> 00:07:48.560
Time for warm-ups!

00:07:48.560 --> 00:07:50.440
She sells sea shells by the sea sloth.

00:07:50.440 --> 00:07:52.700
The sixth sick sheikh's sixth sloth's sick.

00:07:50.440 --> 00:07:53.700
I don't believe it. What did 
you do to her, dumb dog?

00:07:52.700 --> 00:07:54.670
Silly Sally swiftly shooed 
seven silly sloths.

00:07:53.700 --> 00:07:55.320
Now, Jin-san...

00:07:54.670 --> 00:07:56.860
I saw Susie sitting in a sloth shine shop.

00:07:55.320 --> 00:07:57.440
Our training gave her more stamina!

00:07:56.860 --> 00:07:59.300
Six sleek swans swam swiftly slothward...

00:07:57.440 --> 00:07:59.300
It wouldn't happen that fas—

00:07:59.890 --> 00:08:01.220
Miyubi?!

00:07:59.890 --> 00:08:01.220
Stupid sloth!

00:08:07.780 --> 00:08:09.390
I figured.

00:08:09.390 --> 00:08:12.870
Sloths may be poikilothermic, 
but that's still too high.

00:08:12.870 --> 00:08:15.970
Hmm... Her heart rate is elevated, too.

00:08:15.970 --> 00:08:17.890
I'd say she has a mild cold.

00:08:18.220 --> 00:08:20.630
The elevated heart rate from her cold

00:08:20.630 --> 00:08:23.390
must have made her move faster temporarily.

00:08:23.390 --> 00:08:27.900
<i>In general, the faster a mammal moves,
 the faster its heart beats.</i>

00:08:27.900 --> 00:08:36.110
<b>1~2 Billion Beats</b>

00:08:28.330 --> 00:08:34.080
<i>Also, most mammals' hearts beat one 
to two billion times in a lifetime,</i>

00:08:34.080 --> 00:08:39.400
<i>but the sloth is unique in that its 
heart only lasts about 80 million beats.</i>

00:08:35.990 --> 00:08:39.410
<b>80 Million Beats</b>

00:08:39.410 --> 00:08:42.060
Stay here and rest until your fever goes down.

00:08:42.060 --> 00:08:44.110
Kuwano-sensei will look after you.

00:08:44.110 --> 00:08:47.020
That's right. Just rest, 
and you'll be better in no time.

00:08:47.020 --> 00:08:48.420
No!

00:08:49.090 --> 00:08:50.810
I don't want to get better.

00:08:51.340 --> 00:08:55.200
The way I am now, I won't hold 
everyone back at Field Day.

00:08:55.200 --> 00:08:56.860
I know how you feel.

00:08:57.750 --> 00:08:59.830
I wanted to participate with you.

00:09:00.260 --> 00:09:02.350
We worked so hard to train together.

00:09:03.290 --> 00:09:04.180
But...

00:09:04.180 --> 00:09:07.210
What matters most right now 
is that you get better.

00:09:07.210 --> 00:09:08.250
But...

00:09:08.250 --> 00:09:11.260
And we'll all do the best 
we can in your place!

00:09:11.260 --> 00:09:13.440
We'll give you the gift of victory!

00:09:13.950 --> 00:09:15.530
Ranka-chan...

00:09:25.130 --> 00:09:27.580
As of this moment, the Seton—

00:09:27.580 --> 00:09:29.540
Whoa, wait!

00:09:31.610 --> 00:09:34.630
Field Day... will now begin!

00:09:38.140 --> 00:09:40.140
Field Day is a healthy activity.

00:09:40.580 --> 00:09:42.890
Everyone's dressed lighter than usual.

00:09:43.590 --> 00:09:44.890
The first event is...

00:09:44.890 --> 00:09:46.390
the footrace!

00:09:48.770 --> 00:09:50.690
Do you think Ranka-chan can win?

00:09:50.690 --> 00:09:53.400
Well, she is a wolf. She should do okay.

00:09:53.400 --> 00:09:56.450
I doubt she'll beat the cheetah 
or the horse, though.

00:09:56.450 --> 00:09:57.900
Set!

00:09:58.990 --> 00:10:00.410
Go!

00:10:01.740 --> 00:10:03.810
<i>Seton Academy's Field Day is a chance</i>

00:10:03.810 --> 00:10:06.800
<i>for the students to compete 
using the natural abilities they</i>

00:10:06.800 --> 00:10:08.160
<i>don't often get to use.</i>

00:10:08.160 --> 00:10:10.880
<i>Some use their claws, some use their hooves,</i>

00:10:11.550 --> 00:10:13.300
<i>and others use...</i>

00:10:14.800 --> 00:10:15.920
Dumb dog!

00:10:14.810 --> 00:10:15.920
Ranka-chan!

00:10:17.760 --> 00:10:19.510
<i>...intelligence and tools.</i>

00:10:19.510 --> 00:10:22.070
<i>Chimpanzees are extremely intelligent.</i>

00:10:22.070 --> 00:10:25.770
<i>They are the only apes besides 
humans that can use fire.</i>

00:10:25.770 --> 00:10:27.270
That's cheating!

00:10:28.420 --> 00:10:31.830
No one stands a chance against 
our boss, Saruhara Pan-sama!

00:10:31.830 --> 00:10:33.500
Spanky spank!

00:10:33.500 --> 00:10:34.610
Hey!

00:10:34.610 --> 00:10:37.320
Talk about a bunch of arrogant, rude bastards!

00:10:37.320 --> 00:10:39.490
This coming from <i>you</i>, Jin-san?

00:10:39.490 --> 00:10:41.970
The second event is the high jump!

00:10:49.210 --> 00:10:51.510
The obstacle race!

00:10:51.510 --> 00:10:52.710
The mock cavalry battle!

00:10:52.710 --> 00:10:54.960
Fishing!

00:10:56.730 --> 00:10:57.510
Lions

00:10:56.730 --> 00:10:58.470
Impalas

00:10:56.960 --> 00:10:58.760
Rabbits

00:10:57.670 --> 00:10:58.760
Chimpanzees

00:10:59.720 --> 00:11:02.420
Those damn apes. They're way ahead of everyone.

00:11:02.420 --> 00:11:04.050
And we're...

00:11:03.490 --> 00:11:04.220
Horses

00:11:03.490 --> 00:11:05.220
Mice

00:11:04.300 --> 00:11:06.470
Cooking Club

00:11:06.470 --> 00:11:08.970
We'll never win at this rate.

00:11:08.970 --> 00:11:11.350
Let's eat our lunch and get our strength up.

00:11:11.760 --> 00:11:12.650
Huh?

00:11:15.020 --> 00:11:16.500
That was yummy!

00:11:16.500 --> 00:11:17.400
Damn you!

00:11:17.400 --> 00:11:19.850
Don't just show up randomly 
at times like this!

00:11:26.260 --> 00:11:27.910
Hey, dumb dog.

00:11:27.910 --> 00:11:30.370
Why are you over here looking depressed?

00:11:30.370 --> 00:11:34.530
Because... Because the 
cooking club has zero points.

00:11:35.750 --> 00:11:41.010
Ugh, it's no use! It's over! We're done!

00:11:39.230 --> 00:11:41.010
Quit howling like a dog that lost a fight!

00:11:46.720 --> 00:11:47.830
Grr!

00:11:47.830 --> 00:11:49.980
There's no hope, is there?

00:11:49.980 --> 00:11:53.900
There's no way we can win now.

00:11:55.560 --> 00:12:00.420
Get it together! You promised you'd 
give Miyubi the gift of victory, right?

00:12:00.420 --> 00:12:01.320
Jin...

00:12:01.320 --> 00:12:03.590
So stop being pathetic.

00:12:04.450 --> 00:12:05.820
You're our...

00:12:05.820 --> 00:12:07.580
our pack's boss, aren't you?

00:12:08.670 --> 00:12:09.700
Boss...

00:12:14.830 --> 00:12:16.840
Thanks, Jin!

00:12:16.840 --> 00:12:20.590
I almost forgot my pride as the boss!

00:12:20.590 --> 00:12:22.840
Cut it out, damn it!

00:12:27.970 --> 00:12:29.230
Ranka-chan...

00:12:30.770 --> 00:12:32.630
<i>Seton Academy: Join the Pack!</i>

00:12:32.630 --> 00:12:34.980
<i>Western gorilla!</i>

00:12:35.690 --> 00:12:37.610
<i>Seton Academy: Join the Pack!</i>

00:12:37.610 --> 00:12:39.980
<i>Chimpanzee!</i>

00:12:41.780 --> 00:12:42.990
<b>Seton Academy Field Day</b>

00:12:43.300 --> 00:12:45.240
The afternoon portion of 
Field Day will consist of

00:12:45.240 --> 00:12:48.510
Seton Academy's famous athletic race!

00:12:45.240 --> 00:12:48.660
<b>Snowy Mountain Course</b>

00:12:45.240 --> 00:12:50.490
<b>Desert Course</b>

00:12:48.370 --> 00:12:50.490
<b>Lake Course</b>

00:12:48.510 --> 00:12:50.490
The team that wins this race

00:12:49.280 --> 00:12:50.490
<b>Jungle Course</b>

00:12:50.490 --> 00:12:53.650
will instantly earn 300 points!

00:12:55.750 --> 00:12:58.290
These are maps of the race.

00:12:58.290 --> 00:12:59.130
Here you go.

00:12:59.450 --> 00:13:01.170
Why are we doing this?

00:13:01.170 --> 00:13:04.130
It makes no sense that we 
can't take part in Field Day.

00:13:04.130 --> 00:13:07.470
I thought we could get our 
own club room if we won!

00:13:07.470 --> 00:13:09.900
A herd isn't about numbers! 
It's about unity!

00:13:09.900 --> 00:13:11.390
Hey, dumb donkeys.

00:13:11.390 --> 00:13:12.970
You're up.

00:13:13.980 --> 00:13:16.130
The first course is the snowy mountain!

00:13:16.130 --> 00:13:18.980
Each team will send a pair of 
competitors to run the course.

00:13:20.010 --> 00:13:21.370
Why do we have to do this?

00:13:21.370 --> 00:13:23.190
How'd we end up being the 
cooking club's ringers?

00:13:24.110 --> 00:13:25.180
I can't!

00:13:25.180 --> 00:13:26.730
You have to! We'll die!

00:13:26.730 --> 00:13:28.820
We can't make it through 
a snowy mountain course!

00:13:28.820 --> 00:13:30.120
No, you can!

00:13:30.870 --> 00:13:33.370
When the famous human, Napoleon,

00:13:33.370 --> 00:13:37.120
crossed the Alps to launch 
a surprise attack on Italy,

00:13:37.120 --> 00:13:39.630
he rode not on a horse, but on a donkey!

00:13:46.060 --> 00:13:47.310
Keep it up!

00:13:47.310 --> 00:13:49.010
You're in the lead now!

00:13:49.010 --> 00:13:52.130
Donkeys have unlimited potential!

00:13:52.130 --> 00:13:55.270
<i>That donkey crossed at a much 
lower elevation, though.</i>

00:13:55.270 --> 00:13:57.770
<b>Arm Wrestling</b>

00:13:55.580 --> 00:13:57.770
The second course is arm wrestling!

00:13:58.110 --> 00:13:59.530
Arm wrestling, huh?

00:13:59.530 --> 00:14:01.470
All right! Get up there, dumb koala!

00:14:01.470 --> 00:14:02.400
Right!

00:14:07.650 --> 00:14:10.060
<i>Gorillas have a grip strength 
exceeding 500 kilograms.</i>

00:14:10.060 --> 00:14:12.700
<i>They can snap a bamboo tree with a 
diameter of 120 centimeters in half.</i>

00:14:13.580 --> 00:14:17.660
<i>But urban legends say that koalas 
have a grip strength of one ton.</i>

00:14:18.450 --> 00:14:19.930
That was great, Yukari!

00:14:19.930 --> 00:14:21.670
We might be able to win this thing!

00:14:23.970 --> 00:14:28.060
They shouldn't be able to catch up to 
us with those wimpy humans on their team!

00:14:28.060 --> 00:14:28.880
No.

00:14:28.880 --> 00:14:31.220
They may be bald, but they're still primates.

00:14:31.220 --> 00:14:33.640
We don't want to underestimate them.

00:14:33.990 --> 00:14:36.890
We should probably do something about this.

00:14:40.170 --> 00:14:41.900
This is the fourth course.

00:14:42.510 --> 00:14:45.010
You have to swim all the way to the other side.

00:14:45.010 --> 00:14:47.190
Will you be okay, Hitomi-san?

00:14:47.190 --> 00:14:49.820
Sure. I was on the swim team in middle school.

00:14:49.820 --> 00:14:54.910
And I know Jin-kun is doing his best 
on the third course right now.

00:15:00.040 --> 00:15:04.530
<i>It's said that, except in cold regions,
 humans are the only animal</i>

00:15:04.530 --> 00:15:06.710
<i>that can run for long distances without rest.</i>

00:15:06.710 --> 00:15:08.800
Seriously?

00:15:08.800 --> 00:15:10.550
<b>Locker Rooms</b>

00:15:35.370 --> 00:15:36.700
Emergency!

00:15:37.070 --> 00:15:39.010
He collapsed as he crossed the goal line!

00:15:39.010 --> 00:15:40.260
He's in bad shape!

00:15:40.260 --> 00:15:42.210
Jin! Hitomi's in trouble!

00:15:42.210 --> 00:15:43.210
Hitomi-chan?!

00:15:43.210 --> 00:15:44.080
He recovered!

00:15:46.100 --> 00:15:48.890
It's all right. She's only sleeping.

00:15:48.890 --> 00:15:50.130
But why...

00:15:50.130 --> 00:15:53.340
Incidentally, this was found beside her.

00:15:53.690 --> 00:15:55.690
Sniff, sniff, sniff... This is...

00:15:55.690 --> 00:15:58.810
This has been soaked in a mixture 
of several herb extracts!

00:15:55.870 --> 00:15:58.810
<b>* Exposition Line</b>

00:15:58.810 --> 00:15:59.940
Herbs?

00:15:59.940 --> 00:16:01.470
A sleeping drug.

00:16:01.470 --> 00:16:03.620
Those damn chimps did this.

00:16:04.310 --> 00:16:09.220
<i>Chimpanzees have been observed to use at least</i>

00:16:09.220 --> 00:16:13.570
<i>20 different types of herbs to treat 
diarrhea, parasites, and other maladies.</i>

00:16:16.200 --> 00:16:19.700
We have no choice but to have the 
dumb koala handle the lake cour—

00:16:19.700 --> 00:16:20.930
Are you that stupid?!

00:16:20.930 --> 00:16:21.710
I'll do it!

00:16:22.120 --> 00:16:25.460
You need to save your strength 
for the last course.

00:16:25.460 --> 00:16:27.170
Who's going to do it, then?

00:16:28.510 --> 00:16:31.170
I'll... do it.

00:16:33.680 --> 00:16:35.320
Miyubi!

00:16:35.320 --> 00:16:39.450
My cold... is better... now.

00:16:39.450 --> 00:16:42.430
See? You can... tell...

00:16:42.430 --> 00:16:45.450
It's true! She's back to 
dying the same as always!

00:16:45.450 --> 00:16:47.190
You do seem to be over the cold,

00:16:47.190 --> 00:16:49.760
but there's no way a sloth can swim that far.

00:16:49.760 --> 00:16:51.190
Besides, you've only just recovered.

00:16:51.530 --> 00:16:53.080
I can swim.

00:16:53.080 --> 00:16:54.200
I want...

00:16:54.940 --> 00:17:00.450
I want... to be... helpful to all of you, too.

00:17:01.190 --> 00:17:04.210
I will... swim the whole way!

00:17:08.210 --> 00:17:09.900
We're nearing the end at last!

00:17:09.900 --> 00:17:13.720
Only two courses remain in the athletic race.

00:17:13.720 --> 00:17:16.550
The competitors are entering the 
lake to make the swim, one by one.

00:17:16.550 --> 00:17:18.110
What's this?!

00:17:18.110 --> 00:17:22.470
It looks like the cooking club is 
sending Miyubi to complete this course!

00:17:22.470 --> 00:17:24.560
Wait, can sloths even swim?

00:17:24.560 --> 00:17:26.350
Won't she just sink right there?

00:17:28.480 --> 00:17:31.260
If you get into trouble, we'll pull you out!

00:17:31.260 --> 00:17:32.980
Miyubi can make it across for sure.

00:17:33.560 --> 00:17:35.700
Miyubi! Keep it up!

00:17:38.740 --> 00:17:41.750
You don't have to respond! 
Just focus on swimming!

00:17:44.290 --> 00:17:45.940
Not half bad.

00:17:45.940 --> 00:17:48.900
Swimming is the one thing 
sloths are good at.

00:17:48.900 --> 00:17:51.420
Still... it ends here!

00:17:57.930 --> 00:18:00.230
This is bad. She's really worn out.

00:18:00.230 --> 00:18:01.750
We should stop her.

00:18:01.750 --> 00:18:02.810
It's okay.

00:18:02.810 --> 00:18:04.560
What part of that do you call "okay"?!

00:18:05.080 --> 00:18:08.060
She's not even halfway through!
 She can't finish!

00:18:08.060 --> 00:18:09.310
She can!

00:18:10.310 --> 00:18:14.770
Miyubi trained really hard for this day.

00:18:15.690 --> 00:18:20.150
And she said she wants to be helpful to us.

00:18:20.150 --> 00:18:20.950
So...

00:18:21.410 --> 00:18:24.200
It's my job as the boss to have faith in her!

00:18:30.890 --> 00:18:32.630
She's using tools again?!

00:18:37.660 --> 00:18:38.770
That was dirty!

00:18:38.770 --> 00:18:39.610
Miyubi!

00:18:41.760 --> 00:18:43.390
See ya later!

00:18:44.510 --> 00:18:46.750
Grab on, dumb sloth!

00:18:53.110 --> 00:18:54.980
She hasn't given up yet!

00:18:56.990 --> 00:18:59.340
Hey, she might actually be really good.

00:18:59.340 --> 00:19:00.740
She is!

00:19:00.740 --> 00:19:03.290
She might even make it to the end.

00:19:03.290 --> 00:19:04.070
Yeah!

00:19:04.070 --> 00:19:04.990
Go for it!

00:19:08.500 --> 00:19:10.210
You can do it, Miyubi!

00:19:10.770 --> 00:19:12.820
Miyubi, fight!

00:19:13.590 --> 00:19:14.840
You can do it!

00:19:14.840 --> 00:19:15.700
Yes!

00:19:15.700 --> 00:19:17.740
Go, go, Miyubi!

00:19:15.980 --> 00:19:17.210
<b>Cooking Club</b>

00:19:17.210 --> 00:19:19.220
<b>Wolf</b>

00:19:17.210 --> 00:19:19.220
<b>Cooking Club</b>

00:19:17.740 --> 00:19:19.220
Go, go, Miyubi!

00:19:19.220 --> 00:19:22.470
Hooray! Hooray! Miyubi!

00:19:22.470 --> 00:19:25.970
Hooray! Hooray! Miyubi! Hooray! Hooray! Miyubi!

00:19:26.380 --> 00:19:30.100
Hooray! Hooray! Miyubi! Hooray! Hooray! Miyubi!

00:19:30.100 --> 00:19:32.980
Hooray! Hooray! Miyubi! Hooray! Hooray!

00:19:30.100 --> 00:19:32.980
Wait, why am I dressed like this?!

00:19:34.690 --> 00:19:36.420
What's that cheering?

00:19:40.360 --> 00:19:42.780
She hasn't given up!

00:19:43.200 --> 00:19:46.030
You can do it, Miyubi-san!

00:19:46.030 --> 00:19:48.040
Miyubi! Miyubi!

00:19:48.040 --> 00:19:52.000
Miyubi! Miyubi! Miyubi!

00:19:52.000 --> 00:19:54.000
I told you! Don't respond!

00:19:54.900 --> 00:19:56.620
Oh, fine! Do what you want! But in return...

00:19:56.620 --> 00:19:59.760
You have to make it to the goal!

00:20:00.150 --> 00:20:01.950
If you drown, I'll kill you!

00:20:07.760 --> 00:20:10.020
<b>Goal</b>

00:20:19.480 --> 00:20:20.900
Miyubi!

00:20:23.510 --> 00:20:25.590
You did it!

00:20:29.370 --> 00:20:31.000
Miyubi!

00:20:31.000 --> 00:20:32.910
That was amazing, Miyubi-san!

00:20:34.710 --> 00:20:36.670
Well done, sloth!

00:20:36.980 --> 00:20:42.830
Because... Ranka-chan... believed in... me.

00:20:42.940 --> 00:20:45.300
<b>Miyubi: Dead</b>

00:20:43.350 --> 00:20:45.300
Miyubi-chan!

00:20:45.300 --> 00:20:47.820
That's the way. Die and take it easy.

00:20:48.300 --> 00:20:49.390
Hey, dumb dog!

00:20:49.390 --> 00:20:50.810
Go win this!

00:20:51.220 --> 00:20:52.140
Right!

00:20:53.730 --> 00:20:56.270
I won't let Miyubi's hard work go to waste!

00:20:57.400 --> 00:20:59.900
The last course is the jungle!

00:20:59.900 --> 00:21:03.450
The goal's just ahead! I've got this in the bag!

00:21:05.070 --> 00:21:07.090
<i>Wolves are masters of the chase.</i>

00:21:07.090 --> 00:21:08.580
<i>In low temperatures, they can run at</i>

00:21:08.580 --> 00:21:12.660
<i>30 kilometers per hour for 24 hours straight!</i>

00:21:12.660 --> 00:21:14.000
You little mutt!

00:21:14.000 --> 00:21:18.080
There's no way you're gonna beat us!

00:21:19.710 --> 00:21:21.460
She bit it in two?!

00:21:22.670 --> 00:21:24.110
Damn it!

00:21:27.140 --> 00:21:30.610
O-Okay, okay! I apologize 
for everything!

00:21:30.610 --> 00:21:33.930
Hey, I know! I'd be glad to join your pack!

00:21:39.150 --> 00:21:42.210
The next time you mess 
with any of my packmates,

00:21:42.210 --> 00:21:44.150
you'll be the one I bite in two!

00:21:55.150 --> 00:21:58.780
The cooking club wins!

00:21:59.960 --> 00:22:01.960
<b>Wolf</b>

00:21:59.960 --> 00:22:01.960
<b>Ranka</b>

00:22:13.240 --> 00:22:15.730
<b>Seton Academy
Field Day 

00:22:20.450 --> 00:22:22.620
What a boring day this has been.

00:22:22.620 --> 00:22:24.610
You won't believe this, Kuroe-san!

00:22:24.610 --> 00:22:26.540
The cooking club said...

00:22:26.540 --> 00:22:29.110
...they'll lend us their club 
room to thank us for today!

00:22:31.530 --> 00:22:33.330
You did help us out!

00:22:33.330 --> 00:22:35.370
You only get one corner, though.

00:22:37.380 --> 00:22:39.620
Thank you!

00:22:41.170 --> 00:22:43.410
You really look happy, Ranka-chan.

00:22:43.410 --> 00:22:44.380
Yeah!

00:22:44.750 --> 00:22:49.770
Because this trophy is proof that our 
cooking club is recognized as a pack!

00:22:47.130 --> 00:22:54.510
<b>Winners</b>

00:22:49.760 --> 00:22:54.510
<b>Seton Academy
Field Day

00:22:55.610 --> 00:22:57.390
We need to keep it safe!

00:22:57.390 --> 00:22:59.020
You're not putting it up for all to see?

00:22:59.020 --> 00:23:04.020
<i>Wolves have a tendency to hide food and 
other things that are valuable to them.</i>

00:23:06.780 --> 00:23:08.780
Activate effect!

00:23:08.780 --> 00:23:11.780
All these cards are mine now!

00:23:11.780 --> 00:23:14.700
You don't know, Jin? We can't 
put it where everyone can see!

00:23:15.010 --> 00:23:17.450
It's a secret for the cooking club alone!

00:23:16.190 --> 00:23:18.130
Quit hopping up and down!

00:23:18.130 --> 00:23:20.170
I don't care about some stupid secret!

00:23:19.710 --> 00:23:23.190
<b>Winners</b>

00:23:19.710 --> 00:23:23.190
<b>Seton Academy
Field Day

00:23:20.170 --> 00:23:22.830
Don't tell anyone we put it there!

00:23:24.960 --> 00:23:25.980
<b>Next Time</b>

00:23:25.980 --> 00:23:26.860
<b>Ranka here!</b>

00:23:26.860 --> 00:23:28.420
<b>The next story is about someone everybody knows...</b>

00:23:28.420 --> 00:23:30.300
<b>Someone who's famous all over the world</b>

00:23:30.300 --> 00:23:32.180
<b>is coming to this school!</b>

00:23:32.180 --> 00:23:34.100
<b>So I'll have to</b>

00:23:34.100 --> 00:23:36.100
<b>welcome her with lots of licking!!</b>

00:23:36.100 --> 00:23:38.580
<b>.....Wait, she's not trying to take over as boss, is she!?</b>

00:23:38.580 --> 00:23:40.250
<b>Seton Academy Record 6</b>

00:23:38.580 --> 00:23:40.250
<b>The Legend of the Panda Girl</b>
